{"etape": 6, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-21T11:53:21.906283Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "I've checked your existing flights. Here's the situation:\n\nBecause your reservation is **basic economy**, the flights themselves cannot be modified (so I can't switch you to a different/cheaper routing). The only option is to **upgrade the cabin to business on your existing flights**, which are all available in business:\n\n| Flight | Route | Date | Business price (per passenger) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| HAT023 | JFK → SFO | 2024-05-26 | $364 |\n| HAT204 | SFO → SEA | 2024-05-28 | $248 |\n| HAT021 | SEA → JFK | 2024-05-28 | $453 |\n\nPer passenger total: **$1,065**\nFor all 3 passengers: **$3,195**\n\nYou originally paid **$567**, so the amount due would be **$2,628**.\n\nFor the payment/refund method on this change, I'd need a single credit card or gift card from your profile. (Note: your gift cards total only $327, so a credit card would be needed to cover the difference.)\n\nWould you like to proceed with upgrading all three flights to business for all 3 passengers? If so, please tell me which payment method to use."}, "resultat": "Thank you for checking that. Since the basic economy cannot be changed directly, I'd prefer to cancel the current reservation and book a new one for the cheapest business round trip, keeping the same dates. I want to minimize the payment from my Mastercard.\n\nCould you please tell me the sum of my gift card balances and certificate balances first? Then, we can look into the cost of cancelling and rebooking, and how much my Mastercard would be charged.", "erreur": null}
